# The image is built from the workspace manifest, the lock file and the crates (the
# known-client dataset lives in crates/fingerprint/data), plus the systemd unit that
# `mirrust install` embeds (crates/server/src/install.rs). The tests'
# corpus files are not needed to build the binary. If non-test code gains another
# include_str! outside crates/, add its file here, or the Docker build fails.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!deploy/mirrust.service
# Build output inside a crate directory, if a build was run in place.
**/target
